        "raw": "<p>Yeah that sounds correct. Even though Tachyon would shuffle her discard, I wouldnt consider her &quot;out of the game&quot;. She still has a great deal of Utility to her, and doubling up on some of those cards might be enough to offset the damage loss. Tachyon can destroy Environment cards too remember! You could always abuse Meteor Storm and just buy time until her discard is full again, though this would be a very long road to trod.</p>",
